[b]Haiduk[/b] is a quick single chat with one model, no meeting. It can:
• be "dressed" into any role (the "+" button);
• accept documents (paperclip, up to 5 files);
• web search (globe) on providers that support it.

Difference from a meeting: one opinion instead of a council — but instant and with zero setup. History persists between launches; "Clear chat" removes messages only (documents stay), changing the role is a full reset.
